    "detailed_description": "&quot;Who am I, what am I? I'm a robot, right? Anyway, I've got a couple of Objectives I don't have time for right now.&quot; <br><br>- You'll be asking this all game, Abyssal Reflections is short Atmospheric depressing &quot;non-jumpscare&quot; game where you go through a total of 8 different time periods. You'll have to take care of your owners and how you relate to them is up to you.<br><br><strong>Key elements:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interaction with every character in the game.<br></li><li>Dark and isolated atmosphere.</li><li>Interacting with the environment, such as cleaning or clearing up messes.<br></li><li>Fully controllable in-game OS home charger, with bags and information, allowing you to end your work shift.</li><li>Thirty-minute gameplay featuring a linear horror storyline with different, unique events that change the experience, making even mundane cleaning tasks suspenseful.</li></ul><br><strong>CREDISTS</strong><br>Used models:<br>Male Character PS1-Style (vinrax)<br>Old Radio (Red Fox / nokillnando)<br><br>Used music:<br>Sewerslvt - Cyberia lyr2",
